{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-15T08:34:42.419Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489731d8ab76ae02b28618d0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1336+pm-gh1724","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-15T08:34:42.418Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Verification evidence (2026-11-15, branch feat/stale-work-visibility-and-takeover):\n\n- **Shared scan.** `scanInProgressWork` and `inspectInProgressWork` classify in-progress work into `unowned`, `idle` and `stale` from one activity clock. History is read only for items whose `updated_at` already looks idle or is unparseable. `stale_in_progress_items` keeps its exact population.\n- **Health.** `in_progress_unowned:<n>` and `in_progress_idle:<n>` are advisory (`ok` unchanged), live under `details.in_progress_work` with bounded ids and sweeps, and appear in `remediation_map` with the configured status and threshold. A sandbox run with the threshold at 48 shows `pm list --status in_progress --updated-before -48h`. The registry now also covers `stale_in_progress_items`.\n- **Context.** The summary carries `in_progress_unowned` and `in_progress_idle` next to `in_progress`, only when non-zero (absent when every in-progress item is held and active).\n- **Linked tests.** `pm test pm-gh1724 --run` passed (run test-local-mwhkuzp5-lrc3ay).\n- **Full suite.** 12,808 tests passed. The only failures were the token-budget pin and an SDK snapshot refresh, both fixed. Exact 100% coverage still needs a final run on the exact head, which follows below.\n- **Token-budget fixture.** Its in-progress child is now owned by the fixture author, so the documented `health --check-only` ceiling of 164 tokens holds (measured 159). An unowned in-progress child is itself a GH-1724 advisory.\n- **Calibration.** The context-intent calibration re-approved one change: the scale-tier context summary gained 22 bytes for `in_progress_idle`.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-15T08:34:42.419Z"}],"before_hash":"24c0479c3c4b9a4d5513e230224b9878847dfcd0cf6c9f97c71aa2fb1d616e81","after_hash":"c42113673e6ada9b5b41aa58152671798d555c8abb82381e1863e0a4fb2a5f61","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"6ee386387e05e22682add94aa6bbd94702d2c7ac9f4c8b9df88bcf7853838414"}
